  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">IN ORATIONES</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1">DANIELIS HEINSII,</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="1">HVGONIS GROTII</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="1">EPIGRAMMA.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">POst dignum Latio pedem cothurno,</l>
    <l n="6">Post Rossæ teneras amationes,</l>
    <l n="7">Scriptas carmine, quale Naso, quale</l>
    <l n="8">Romanus cupetet suum Philetas,</l>
    <l n="9">Post Flacci cithaam, tubam Maronis,</l>
    <l n="10">Post tantæ trimetros seueritatis</l>
    <l n="11">Vt rugas superent Catonianos,</l>
    <l n="12">Jam Demosthenicæ sitior undæ</l>
    <l n="13">Linquis Pegaseos, amice, fontes,</l>
    <l n="14">Regnans eloquio solutiore,</l>
    <l n="15">Dum nunc ingenii fluentis æstum</l>
    <l n="16">Libertas tibi Tulliana laxat,</l>
    <l n="17">Nunc facundia Plinium secuta</l>
    <l n="18">Constringi studet arctiore gyro,</l>
    <l n="19">Nunc docti Senecæ refert acumen</l>
    <l n="20">Densis pagina seminata gemmis.</l>
    <l n="21">Heinsi, viue diu, diuque de te</l>
    <l n="22">Certet Suada potens, nouemque</l>
    <l n="23">Musæ, Quitquid nominibus prioris ævi</l>
    <l n="24">Æternam potuit parare famam,</l>
    <l n="25">Hoc in te liceat stuperte</l>
    <l n="26">solo. Millenis facibus superba nox est:</l>
    <l n="27">Astrum sufficit vnicum diêi.</l>
  </main_text>
</page>
